{"id": "34011", "title": "总裁魅力学分", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 48, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34011.htm", "intro": "但区区一个送公文的小妹，只喜欢酷男秘书不喜欢他？眼看情场浪子的封号就要被人砸了招牌——不行！他一定要扭转她「错误」想法，让她了解他的好！只要让她多跟他相处，她一定会改变对他的观感。他煞费苦心安排好一切，就只差最后临门一脚……一场意外的相遇，让程诗颖邂逅忧郁美形男；她不惜混入他的公司当小妹，只求爱情开花结果。眼前堂堂总裁主动送上门，要当她的追爱狗头军师，却没想到他居然设计她，害她失恋得这幺惨，恋爱学分不及格不说，还不负责地骗走她的心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34011", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2163583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2163584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2163585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2163586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2163587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2163588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2163589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2163590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2163591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2163592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2163593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2163594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2163595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2163596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2163597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2163598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2163599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2163600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2163601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2163602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2163603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2163604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2163605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2163606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2163607.html"